211
00:17:15,812 --> 00:17:16,854
Yes!

212
00:17:17,937 --> 00:17:20,062
I'm in the right frame of mind

213
00:17:21,021 --> 00:17:23,312
to discuss our relationship.

214
00:17:24,729 --> 00:17:28,646
We must decide today. Okay. Come on.

215
00:17:49,021 --> 00:17:49,896
Ka...

