scare us.

241
00:19:54,104 --> 00:19:57,146
But think of the hard life
he had to lead.

242
00:19:57,687 --> 00:19:59,562
He worked around the clock

243
00:19:59,646 --> 00:20:03,021
to make up for everything he lost
