That's what he's trying to do.

247
00:20:14,812 --> 00:20:16,771
He's never mentioned a will.

248
00:20:16,937 --> 00:20:19,021
For God's sake, be quiet.

249
00:20:19,354 --> 00:20:21,312
Why are you after my life?

250
00:20:21,562 --> 00:20:24,021
