We will fight!

505
00:37:07,937 --> 00:37:10,021
We will not be divided.

506
00:37:11,771 --> 00:37:13,854
We will not be divided.

507
00:37:18,146 --> 00:37:21,604
It hasn't even started.

508
00:37:23,229 --> 00:37:25,312
Does it make sense?

509
00:37:29,854 --> 00:37:34,271
Look, they're here.
The people from Mars.

510
00:37:35,146 --> 00:37:36,771
The Martians.

511
00:37:37,354 --> 00:37:40,521
Recognize their faces!
Recognize them!

512
00:37:41,437 --> 00:37:44,812
Small eyes, and a long tongue...

513
00:37:45,396 --> 00:37:47,479
We will not be divided.

514
00:38:06,396 --> 00:38:08,521
- Mr. Aftab.
- Hello, Afsana.

515
00:38:09,604 --> 00:38:10,604
See?

516
00:38:12,604 --> 00:38:13,562
Now see.

517
00:38:15,229 --> 00:38:16,229
Understand?

518
00:38:19,229 --> 00:38:22,437
My earring must have fallen off

519
00:38:23,604 --> 00:38:24,937
in the old ruins.

520
00:38:26,604 --> 00:38:27,896
What if someone takes it?

521
00:38:33,979 --> 00:38:35,021
Go!

522
00:38:36,646 --> 00:38:37,646
But I...

523
00:38:38,271 --> 00:38:40,437
You're a lion! Go!

524
