Needs repairing.

530
00:39:08,146 --> 00:39:09,146
You need repairs?

531
00:39:10,812 --> 00:39:11,687
No.

532
00:39:12,687 --> 00:39:13,687
My cycle.

533
00:39:15,896 --> 00:39:17,021
Are you in a hurry?

534
00:39:18,312 --> 00:39:19,521
Should I ride the cycle?

535
00:39:21,646 --> 00:39:22,521
Fine.

536
00:39:27,312 --> 00:39:28,354
Ride it together?

537
00:39:33,104 --> 00:39:34,437
That's fine too.

538
00:39:41,812 --> 00:39:43,396
They call you Keenu, the fruit?

539
00:39:44,146 --> 00:39:45,521
Are you an orange?

540
00:39:49,604 --> 00:39:50,729
Hello, Jiya!

541
00:39:52,521 --> 00:39:53,729
I have information too.

542
00:39:55,354 --> 00:39:56,812
Are you someone's sweetheart?

543
00:40:29,646 --> 00:40:31,812
The border was drawn here.

544
00:40:33,146 --> 00:40:35,021
The Punjab was split in two.

545
00:40:35,604 --> 00:40:37,104
East and West.

546
00:40:37,812 --> 00:40:39,729
And this is Sargodha.

547
00:41:02,937 --> 00:41:03,937
My earring!

548
00:41:06,729 --> 00:41:07,646
Found it?

549
00:41:10,146 --> 00:41:11,229
I'm glad.

550
00:41:11,437 --> 00:41:12,687
Is it okay now?

551
00:41:26,312 --> 00:41:27,354
What's wrong?

552
00:41:29,479 --> 00:41:30,729
You're breathing fast.

553
00:41:33,854 --> 00:41:35,729
Hope you're not having a heart attack?

554
00:41:37,604 --> 00:41:38,937
No, no.

555
00:41:40,437 --> 00:41:41,437
What then?

556
00:41:43,437 --> 00:41:44,521
Scared?

557
00:41:46,229 --> 00:41:48,229
- No.
- I am.

558
00:41:51,729 --> 00:41:53,729
What's there to be scared of?

559
00:41:54,229 --> 00:41:58,271
Punjab will be divided. Sikhs and Muslims
will be separated.

560
00:42:02,312 --> 00:42:03,521
Not necessarily.

561
00:42:05,354 --> 00:42:07,354
Everyone can choose their own country.

562
00:42:08,646 --> 00:42:12,146
No one will be asked to leave.
There's no such order.

563
00:42:12,646 --> 00:42:13,521
That's true.

564
00:42:15,229 --> 00:42:18,646
Oh, God! But think
of the Rawalpindi riots.

565
00:42:19,229 --> 00:42:21,937
Those terrible beasts attacked
the common people.

566
00:42:22,979 --> 00:42:24,771
So many have abandoned their homes.

567
00:42:25,437 --> 00:42:28,687
What if that happens here and people
start abandoning their homes?

568
00:42:32,396 --> 00:42:33,937
People have gone crazy.

569
00:42:34,437 --> 00:42:37,229
Who are these people?
They weren't here before.

570
00:42:37,771 --> 00:42:39,229
Where have they come from?

571
00:42:39,812 --> 00:42:42,104
Did they come from Mars in a spaceship?

572
00:42:45,604 --> 00:42:47,729
What? You think it's funny?

573
00:42:51,104 --> 00:42:52,104
That's strange.

574
00:42:55,437 --> 00:42:59,854
These people, who came from Mars
to make trouble

575
00:43:00,812 --> 00:43:04,771
have scared some folk into buying homes
in Amritsar and Delhi.

576
00:43:05,604 --> 00:43:08,604
If things get bad here, they'll go there.

577
00:43:09,979 --> 00:43:13,771
We haven't, because we're staying
right here.

578
00:43:15,521 --> 00:43:18,229
God forbid they come knocking
at your door, what then?

579
00:43:18,812 --> 00:43:19,812
Dear Lord!

580
00:43:21,146 --> 00:43:23,021
- Who? The Martians?
- What?

581
00:43:23,937 --> 00:43:25,646
The men from the spaceship?

582
00:43:27,104 --> 00:43:28,812
Yes.

583
00:43:29,896 --> 00:43:31,687
What if they come to throw you out?

584
00:43:32,021 --> 00:43:34,646
Then I'll come and live here,
among these old ruins.

585
00:43:35,187 --> 00:43:37,646
But this was a Muslim house.

586
00:43:38,604 --> 00:43:41,396
Sikhs and Muslims cannot live
in the same house.

587
00:43:41,771 --> 00:43:43,854
Why not? Of course they can.

588
00:43:44,437 --> 00:43:45,312
But how?

589
00:43:47,937 --> 00:43:51,271
This romantic story from the time
of Partition

590
00:43:51,604 --> 00:43:54,021
has haunted him for 78 years.

591
00:43:55,521 --> 00:43:57,146
Involves a young lady for sure.

592
00:43:57,271 --> 00:43:58,687
Want a real love story?

593
00:43:59,479 --> 00:44:02,604
Ishan has proposed to Indu.

594
00:44:04,729 --> 00:44:05,979
Who's Ishan?

595
00:44:06,937 --> 00:44:08,021
<i>Indu's boyfriend.</i>

596
00:44:08,521 --> 00:44:09,396
Indu?

597
00:44:11,771 --> 00:44:14,937
Oh, I get it! Our Indu.

598
00:44:15,271 --> 00:44:17,396
Yes, my younger sister.

599
00:44:17,854 --> 00:44:22,396
There was so much pressure on me to marry,
now my sister is getting married.

600
00:44:23,896 --> 00:44:28,271
<i>But, of course it's wonderful
and I'm so, so happy for her.</i>

601
00:44:29,604 --> 00:44:31,104
<i>Will you come to the wedding?</i>

602
00:44:32,521 --> 00:44:35,187
But I'm here, in India.

603
00:44:35,729 --> 00:44:38,146
It's in November. By then...

604
00:44:39,146 --> 00:44:43,146
By then grandpa may have...
Yes, but...

605
00:44:45,604 --> 00:44:50,604
if we attend the wedding together,
what will people think, seeing us?

606
00:44:51,729 --> 00:44:54,562
They'll take it as an announcement
that we're...

607
