Kaamna is freezing her eggs.

611
00:45:06,646 --> 00:45:07,937
<i>I told you.</i>

612
00:45:09,729 --> 00:45:11,229
But why are you going?

613
00:45:11,521 --> 00:45:13,812
<i>Just to check it out.</i>

614
00:45:14,604 --> 00:45:16,021
Kaveri, you're too young.

615
00:45:16,437 --> 00:45:18,146
I won't be young forever!

616
00:45:18,812 --> 00:45:20,937
God knows when I'll get married.

617
00:45:21,229 --> 00:45:22,854
And scientifically speaking

618
00:45:23,146 --> 00:45:26,646
better to freeze your eggs
when you're young.

619
00:45:27,521 --> 00:45:31,271
Eggs, Grandpa!
Girls are freezing their eggs.

620
00:45:31,896 --> 00:45:33,521
What's happening to the world?

621
