I thought

678
00:50:52,937 --> 00:50:55,729
I'd take a year to say yes to you.

679
00:50:59,437 --> 00:51:01,062
I'd make you yearn for me.

680
00:51:04,271 --> 00:51:08,562
But what can I do, Keenu?
We're living in dark times.

681
00:51:10,854 --> 00:51:12,937
If we wait, it may be too late.

682
00:51:47,729 --> 00:51:50,521
But since I'm giving myself to you
so easily

683
